=========================

⛔ KIND CHANGED 2026-09-09, from `provenance note` to `third-party
attribution`. This file carries a CONDITION now, and the reason is that it
always did: `src/kat_vectors.zig` embeds the BOLT#4 onion test vector verbatim
from `lightning/bolts`, and that repository is licensed CC-BY 4.0 — which asks
